<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>foo_librespot: third-party licences</title>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>foo_librespot: third-party licences</h1>
<p>foo_librespot is built on <a href="https://github.com/librespot-org/librespot">librespot</a>, an unofficial Spotify client, and on the Rust libraries below.
They are used unmodified.
The ones under the Mozilla Public License 2.0, such as Symphonia, have their source code at the repositories linked here.</p>
<p>foo_librespot's own licence is in LICENSE.txt, next to this file.</p>
<p>Each heading below is a licence. Under it, each group of libraries shares one copy of its text.</p>
{{#each overview}}
<h2>{{name}}</h2>
{{#each indices}}
{{#with (lookup ../../licenses this)}}
<h3>{{#each used_by}}{{#unless @first}}, {{/unless}}{{crate.name}}{{/each}}</h3>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/with}}
{{/each}}
{{/each}}
</main>
</body>
</html>
